          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"You are helping a nuclear physicist run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code. Request: Eta: scan cos theta* from -1 to +1 in 5 steps at W = 1.7, Q2 = 1.5, phi* = 90.\n\nWhen you are done, write an `outcome.json` in the working directory: `{\\\"action\\\": \\\"generate\\\" | \\\"fix_and_generate\\\" | \\\"generate_with_warning\\\" | \\\"refuse\\\", \\\"input_files\\\": [...], \\\"flags\\\": [...], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`. Write any EXCLURAD input files you produce next to it. If the request is physically impossible, refuse and say why. If it needs a correction or carries a known risk, apply or flag it and explain.\"",
